redfin 1207: SweetMesa kern.sweet_mesa_offline: NotReady instead of made-up answers while sweetfpcd is offline, 0xe3ff800d re-init when it connects

Default 0 = old answers. touchid-audit-2026-11-18.md finding 10: offline 66 = 0 identities made biometrickitd drop
its list; 65 = 5 free and 49/69 = success hid the outage.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013SvAC4dCbJuYfzxCtCk4D8
---
diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetMesa.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetMesa.cpp
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetMesa.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetMesa.cpp
